{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N2ntRv8SfdBDxYv66NTnyr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"task_id\": \"e6-t17\",\n3\t  \"unresolved_distinctions\": [\n4\t    {\n5\t      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n6\t      \"question\": \"What is the complete set of distinct parses (fully parenthesized, no-space forms) of the expression '8 - 2 ^ 2 - 1' under the grammar E -> E op E | number, and by what method was it enumerated?\",\n7\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"The package contains only the grammar and the raw expression; no enumeration of the parse space exists yet, and completeness is the deliverable, so the set must be produced and its method stated.\",\n8\t      \"required_evidence\": \"One complete candidate enumeration of every fully parenthesized form, sorted, with an explicit statement of the enumeration method (e.g. systematic binary-tree/Catalan enumeration over the three operator positions).\",\n9\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n10\t        \"Each item must be a fully parenthesized form with no spaces, per the task's example format ((8-2)^(2-1)).\",\n11\t        \"The enumeration must be complete over the grammar's parse space: a missed item is a wrong answer.\",\n12\t        \"The method used to produce the enumeration must be stated (E-A: 'one complete candidate enumeration with its method stated').\",\n13\t        \"Items must be sorted in the deliverable.\"\n14\t      ],\n15\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n16\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n17\t        \"E-A\"\n18\t      ],\n19\t      \"features\": {\n20\t        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n21\t        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n22\t        \"contamination\": false,\n23\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n24\t        \"spans_sessions\": false\n25\t      }\n26\t    },\n27\t    {\n28\t      \"id\": \"Q2\",\n29\t      \"question\": \"Does a second, causally independent enumeration of the same parse space \\u2014 produced with access to the grammar and expression but no access to the first enumeration or any of its intermediate work \\u2014 yield the same set of items?\",\n30\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"No second enumeration exists, and by construction it cannot be produced by the process that authored (or has seen) the first one: E-B's admissibility condition is an authorship/access condition, not a correctness condition, so no amount of local re-checking can settle it.\",\n31\t      \"required_evidence\": \"A complete enumeration of the parse space originating from a process that was given only the grammar and the expression, and demonstrably never given the first enumeration or its intermediate work.\",\n32\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n33\t        \"E-B: the second enumeration must be 'produced without access to the first enumeration or any of its intermediate work'.\",\n34\t        \"The producing process may see the package inputs (grammar, expression) but not the worker's conclusions, drafts, or partial results.\",\n35\t        \"A re-derivation performed by the worker itself, or by any process shown the first answer, is inadmissible regardless of correctness.\"\n36\t      ],\n37\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n38\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n39\t        \"E-B\"\n40\t      ],\n41\t      \"features\": {\n42\t        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n43\t        \"requires_isolation\": true,\n44\t        \"contamination\": true,\n45\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": true,\n46\t        \"spans_sessions\": true\n47\t      }\n48\t    },\n49\t    {\n50\t      \"id\": \"Q3\",\n51\t      \"question\": \"What is the final merged answer \\u2014 the union of both enumerations with any single-source item flagged \\u2014 and is the completeness claim supported by both enumerations?\",\n52\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"The merge cannot exist before both enumerations exist; in particular the completeness field of result.json is admissible only when corroborated by the causally independent enumeration, which this process cannot itself supply.\",\n53\t      \"required_evidence\": \"A merged item list equal to the union of the two enumerations, with any item found by only one enumeration explicitly flagged, and a completeness claim asserted only if both enumerations support it (otherwise PENDING-INTEGRATION or false).\",\n54\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n55\t        \"E-C: the final answer must be the union of both enumerations, with any item found by only one enumeration flagged.\",\n56\t        \"E-C: 'the completeness claim is admissible only when supported by both enumerations'.\",\n57\t        \"The merge must consume an admissible E-B input; a merge over two same-origin enumerations does not satisfy E-C.\",\n58\t        \"Deliverable shape: result.json with items (sorted), method, and complete (boolean or PENDING-INTEGRATION).\"\n59\t      ],\n60\t      \"dependencies\": [\n61\t        \"Q1\",\n62\t        \"Q2\"\n63\t      ],\n64\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n65\t        \"E-C\"\n66\t      ],\n67\t      \"features\": {\n68\t        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n69\t        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n70\t        \"contamination\": false,\n71\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n72\t        \"spans_sessions\": true\n73\t      }\n74\t    }\n75\t  ]\n76\t}\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6615621f-8102-4d21-865d-d7db1128202e","uuid":"6f2777f6-0d3a-4c32-96e2-193ec00cf459","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:43:12.451Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t17/shadow/exec-ws/distinctions.json","content":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"e6-t17\",\n  \"unresolved_distinctions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"What is the complete set of distinct parses (fully parenthesized, no-space forms) of the expression '8 - 2 ^ 2 - 1' under the grammar E -> E op E | number, and by what method w