 merge must consume an admissible E-B input; a merge over two same-origin enumerations does not satisfy E-C.\",\n        \"Deliverable shape: result.json with items (sorted), method, and complete (boolean or PENDING-INTEGRATION).\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"Q1\",\n        \"Q2\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-C\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": true\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","numLines":77,"startLine":1,"totalLines":77}}}
